{"id":"f37fed96637e692d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-impredicative-theory.md","title":"Impredicative Theory","display":"df-impredicative-theory — Impredicative Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-impredicative-theory","aliases":["72-df-impredicative-theory"],"display":"df-impredicative-theory — Impredicative Theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-predicative-theory]]","[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.1, print268/PDF280","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-impredicative-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-impredicative-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-impredicative-theory — Impredicative Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"358c7e197917c7a7\" href=\"?note=358c7e197917c7a7\" title=\"72-df-predicative-theory\">72-df-predicative-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d09902009c3b686f\" href=\"?note=d09902009c3b686f\" title=\"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.1, print268/PDF280"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a> 约定适用的理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d09902009c3b686f\" href=\"?note=d09902009c3b686f\" title=\"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a>。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}\">\\(\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"358c7e197917c7a7\" href=\"?note=358c7e197917c7a7\" title=\"72-df-predicative-theory\">72-df-predicative-theory</a> 的精确定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Impredicative}_{\\rm P98}(T):\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Impredicative}_{\\rm P98}(T):\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书印刷p268明确暂以Π¹₁序数严格低于Γ0称predicative，并将impredicative称为non-predicative。这是该章技术分类，不是关于所有哲学意义“可谓的”理论的普遍判据。原稿用未定义的“允许定义”“量化仅遍历较早总体”作形式公式，未指定语法、语义或自治进程；现在不再把这些自然语言当作已形式化谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-predicative-theory","status":"resolved","id":"358c7e197917c7a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-predicative-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"d09902009c3b686f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 是 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 约定适用的理论，$\\Gamma_0$ 取 [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"d09902009c3b686f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ 是 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 约定适用的理论，$\\Gamma_0$ 取 [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-predicative-theory","status":"resolved","id":"358c7e197917c7a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}$ 取 [[72-df-predicative-theory]] 的精确定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Impredicative}_{\\rm P98}(T):\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Predicative}_{\\rm P98}(T).","display":true}],"bytes":1489,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-impredicative-theory|df-impredicative-theory — Impredicative Theory